# The review records pin the SHA-256 digest of the file bytes. A
# checkout that changes the line endings changes the digest, and the
# record of the review no longer matches the file it describes. The
# line endings are therefore pinned to LF on every platform.
#
# The text files of the repository are UTF-8 with LF. The binary files
# are left to the automatic detection of Git.
* text=auto eol=lf
